flowchart TD
  Input[Input: pending handling or Agent routing] --> Callback[handle_pending or handle_flow]
  Callback --> Acquire[Validate and acquire returned commands]
  Acquire --> Cognitive[Cognitive worker]
  Acquire --> Governed[GAM checks and required consent]
  Governed --> Execute[Recorded Act, then effect adapter]
  Execute --> Outcome[Observed Outcome]
  Cognitive --> Result[handle_result]
  Outcome --> Result
  Result --> Next[Respond, wait or return next commands]
